"evidence":[{"id":"jfj-q0009","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-2cee59cc073dcfb6cefe","layer":"original","quote":"由是琬遂还住涪。疾转增剧〖46〗，至九年卒〖47〗。谥曰恭。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0067","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-44bc679849801b06bb71","layer":"original","quote":"子斌嗣。为绥武将军、汉城护军","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0068","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-44bc679849801b06bb71","layer":"original","quote":"子斌嗣。为绥武将军、汉城护军〖1〗。魏大将（军）钟会至汉城，与斌书曰：“巴蜀贤智文武之士，多矣！至于足下、诸葛思远〖2〗，譬诸草木，吾气类也〖3〗。桑梓之敬〖4〗，古今所敦〖5〗。西到，欲奉瞻尊大君公侯墓〖6〗；当洒扫坟茔，奉祠致敬：愿告其所在。”","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0069","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-44bc679849801b06bb71","layer":"original","quote":"魏大将（军）钟会至汉城，与斌书曰：“巴蜀贤智文武之士，多矣！至于足下、诸葛思远〖2〗，譬诸草木，吾气类也〖3〗。桑梓之敬〖4〗，古今所敦〖5〗。西到，欲奉瞻尊大君公侯墓〖6〗；当洒扫坟茔，奉祠致敬：愿告其所在。”","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0070","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-7e40803b4d8a36956cf3","layer":"original","quote":"斌答书曰：“知惟臭味意眷之隆〖7〗，雅托通流〖8〗，未拒来谓也〖9〗。亡考昔遭疾疢，亡于涪县；卜云其吉〖10〗，遂安厝之〖11〗。知君西迈〖12〗，乃欲屈驾修敬坟墓；视予犹父〖13〗，颜子之仁也。闻命感怆〖14〗，以增情思。”","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0072","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-2271982328015fb58d4b","layer":"original","quote":"会得斌书报，嘉叹意义；及至涪，如其书云。后主既降邓艾；斌诣会于涪，待以交友之礼。随会至成都，为乱兵所杀。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0073","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-2271982328015fb58d4b","layer":"original","quote":"后主既降邓艾；斌诣会于涪，待以交友之礼。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0074","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-2271982328015fb58d4b","layer":"original","quote":"随会至成都，为乱兵所杀。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":40,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0175","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-c57cc7bd9ce74b83ab3b","layer":"original","quote":"于是令督汉中胡济却住汉寿〖5〗，监军王含守乐城，护军蒋斌守汉城；","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0176","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-c57cc7bd9ce74b83ab3b","layer":"original","quote":"于是令督汉中胡济却住汉寿〖5〗，监军王含守乐城，护军蒋斌守汉城；又于西安、建威、武卫、石门、武城、建昌、临远〖6〗，皆立围守。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"jfj-q0261","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-44bc679849801b06bb71","layer":"original","quote":"子斌嗣。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":83,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":4,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0072","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"蜀监军王含守乐城，护军蒋斌守汉城，兵各五千。会使护军荀恺、前将军李辅各统万人：恺围汉城，辅围乐城。会径过，西出阳安口〖7〗，遣人祭诸葛亮之墓〖8〗。使护军胡烈等行前，攻破关城〖9〗，得库藏积谷。姜维自沓中还，至阴平，合集士众，欲赴关城。未到，闻其已破，退趋白水，与蜀将张翼、廖化等合守剑阁拒会〖10〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0455","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-78045a2622266a435eeb","layer":"original","quote":"蜀监军王含守乐城，护军蒋斌守汉城，兵各五千","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":473,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
